<title>TURKEY: Istanbul bourse opens 20 minutes late.</title>
<headline>Istanbul bourse opens 20 minutes late.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical problem delayed the start of trading on the Istanbul Stock Exchange by twenty minutes on Thursday, officials said.</p>
<p>The exchange opened at 0820 GMT after the problem, linked to the introduction today of new price indices, was solved, an official said.</p>
<p>He said the morning session will close 10 minutes late at 1010 GMT.</p>
<p>--Istanbul neswroom +90-212-2750875</p>
